This post will get hands on implementing the theme toggle for a SPA. The example developed in this post will use Tanstack Router and Shadcn however the implementation should be agnostic to your framework and styling solution.

1. Migrate to remix icons
2. Update the code blocks to allow for multiple files and a max size. This may require custom tag.
3. Create a carousel component for images

## Create Project

To follow along, create a new tanstack project with shadcn built-in. You can do this with the following commands:

1. Create Tanstack Router + TailwindCSS + Shadcn Application
```bash
# Create a fresh Tanstack Router application with TailwindCSS and Shadcn
➜  npx create-tsrouter-app@latest
┌  Let's configure your TanStack application
│
◇  Select the router type:
│  File Router - File-based routing structure
│
◇  Would you like to use Tailwind CSS?
│  Yes
│
◇  What add-ons would you like for your project?
└  Shadcn
```

2. (Optional) Use tweakcn to get a custom theme! {% start="3" %}

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add https://tweakcn.com/r/themes/darkmatter.json
```

3. Add in a demo component

